              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Brian C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good stuff. Didn't have any pineapples, so I added 1/2 C of OJ, as well as 6 oz of plain yogurt. I liked it enough and so did my 2 yo. I great way to get him to get the benefits of vegetables...so that's good enough for me!",
            "datePublished": "2012-02-29T16:01:33.220Z"
          },
          {
